      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哦……<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳找我嗎？\n如果是要打寶可夢對戰，我接受喔。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54E62026202600100003110000FF01014F6059B3627E621155CEFF1F000A5982679C662F898162535BF653EF59225C0D6230FF0C621163A553D75594300200100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "順便問一下，<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳是會接近對方\n粗野地對戰的類型嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "98064FBF554F4E004E0BFF0C00100003110000FF01014F6059B3662F670363A58FD15C0D65B9000A7C9791CE57305C0D62307684985E578B55CEFF1F00100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因為從遠處攻擊那樣的對手，\n瀟灑地對戰是我的原則。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E070BA5F9E90608655653B64CA90A36A2376845C0D624BFF0C000A701F705157305C0D6230662F62117684539F5247300200100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我會巧妙地引導自己的寶可夢，\n同時保持距離戰鬥喔。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621167035DE7599957305F155C0E81EA5DF176845BF653EF5922FF0C000A540C66424FDD63018DDD96E262309B255594300200100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然從遠處使出的招式\n需要一點發動時間……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D671365F9E906086554F7F51FA768462DB5F0F000A970089814E009EDE767C52D5664295932026202600100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哎呀……我好像聊得太起勁了。\n後續就用實戰來學習吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 516,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE5440202620266211597D50CF804A5F97592A8D7752C14E863002000A5F8C7E8C5C3175285BE662304F865B787FD25427300200100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "準備好透過實戰來學習時\n就和我搭話吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 580,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6E965099597D900F904E5BE662304F865B787FD26642000A5C31548C6211642D8A715427300200100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳準備好要輸給我了嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B36E965099597D89818F387D6662114E8655CEFF1F00100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "準備好要獲勝了！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6E965099597D8981737252DD4E86FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "稍等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7A0D7B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我也是很忙的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E5F662F5F885FD97684300200100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不靠近對手並瀟灑地對戰\n就是我的興趣！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D97608FD15C0D624B4E26701F705157305C0D6230000A5C31662F6211768482088DA3FF0100100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000E>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真有一套……！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F67094E00595720262026FF0100100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "沒錯！要使出攻擊到遠處的招式\n會需要花一點時間。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C92932FFF0189814F7F51FA653B64CA523090608655768462DB5F0F000A67039700898182B14E009EDE66429593300200100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "相對地距離較短的招式\n就需要移動以靠近對手。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "76F85C0D57308DDD96E28F0377ED768462DB5F0F000A5C319700898179FB52D54EE597608FD15C0D624B300200100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以如果能靠近對手出招的話，\n距離較短的招式會比較有利呢。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE55982679C80FD97608FD15C0D624B51FA62DB76848A71FF0C000A8DDD96E28F0377ED768462DB5F0F67036BD48F03670952295462300200100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "即使如此，我還是堅持選擇用\n拉開距離對戰這種瀟灑的戰鬥方式。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53734F7F59826B64FF0C62119084662F58056301907864C77528000A62C9958B8DDD96E25C0D623090197A2E701F7051768462309B2565B95F0F300200100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "畢竟對戰中的寶可夢太拼命了，\n靠近牠們很可怕啊！！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75627ADF5C0D62304E2D76845BF653EF5922592A62FC547D4E86FF0C000A97608FD1726050115F8853EF6015554AFF01FF0100100002011401280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "能攻擊到遠處的招式要發動時很慢，\n而只能攻擊到近處的招式發動會比較快。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n要瀟灑地靈活運用招式喔。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĨ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
